@{
    var bannerSrc = Url.RenderLinkByJsVersion("~/www/build/styles/Images/promotion/promotion.en-US.jpg");
    var mobileBannerSrc = Url.RenderLinkByJsVersion("~/www/build/styles/Images/promotion/promotion-mobile.en-US.jpg");
}
<div class="banner-promotion">
    <picture>
        <source media="(max-width:400px)" srcset="@(mobileBannerSrc)" type="image/jpeg" />
        <source srcset="@(bannerSrc)" type="image/jpeg" />
        <img class="img-item img-responsive" src="@bannerSrc" alt="@Lang.Promotion" />
    </picture>
</div>
<br />
<div class="info-group">
    <h3 class="header-underline text-red">12BET COMMISSION BOOST</h3>
    <p><strong>Earn up to a whopping 50% Commission!</strong></p>
    <p>Get higher monthly commission rates with ease - simply meet the requirements below to qualify automatically!</p>
</div>
@{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Promotion/_RevenueShareTable.cshtml"); }
<div class="info-group">
    <p class="text-header"><strong>Note -</strong></p>
    <p class="text">
        <ol>
            <li>If the affiliate achieves varying thresholds for [total profit per month] and [qualified active players for a month] then the commission payout will be based on the lower threshold. For instance, if the total Net loss of the affiliate's members for the current month is $46,000, and the Qualified active members are 7, the commission for the period will be 35%.</li>
            <li>By invitation only - If you believe you have a unique proposition that could result in significant Winloss (such as attracting VIP members), you can reach out to the affiliate manager to evaluate the proposition and determine the eligibility.</li>
        </ol>
    </p>
</div>
<div class="info-group">
    <h3 class="header-underline text-red">FDM's POWER</h3>
    <p>In 12BET, extra rewards are always guaranteed. All you need to do is fulfil the stated New FDM's requirements and receive an extra commission in addition to your commission.</p>
</div>
@{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Promotion/_FdmTable.cshtml"); }
<div class="info-group">
    <p class="text-header"><strong>Note - </strong>Every affiliate will receive an extra percentage in addition to the commission they earn, regardless of whether it's a Regular Commission or a 12BET Commission Boost promotion.</p>
</div>
<div class="info-group">
    <p class="text-header"><strong>The commission calculation Example:</strong></p>
    <p>Imagin a ‘Affiliate XYZ’ has a <strong>Net win/loss</strong> of $35,000, and there are 25 qualified active members and 12 FDMs. The total deposit made by FDMs is $3,000. The individual qualifies for both promotions, which are the 12BET Commission Boost and FDM Power.</p>
    <p>To calculate the commission, we first apply the Commission Boost, which is 35% of $35,000, resulting in $12,250.</p>
    <p>Next, we apply FDM Power to the Commission Boost amount, which is 3%. Therefore, the FDM Power bonus is $367.5, but since the maximum bonus is $250, the commission will be $12,250 + $250 = $12,500.</p>
    <p>Thus, the total commission earned by the Affiliate XYZ is $12,500.</p>
</div>
<h3 class="header-underline text-red">TERMS AND CONDITIONS</h3>
<div class="info-group">
    <p class="text-header"><strong>Monthly Commission Boost</strong></p>
    <p class="text">
        <ol>
            <li>This promotion applies to all 12BET Affiliates.</li>
            <li>If the affiliate achieves varying thresholds for [total profit per month] and [qualified active players for a month] then the commission payout will be based on the lower threshold.</li>
            <li>Non-qualifiers of this promotion will continue to earn commissions based on the existing <a href="@Url.Content("~/CommissionStructure")">Regular commission structure.</a></li>
            <li>By invitation only - If you believe you have a unique proposition that could result in significant Winloss (such as attracting VIP members), you can reach out to the affiliate manager to evaluate the proposition and determine the eligibility.</li>
            <li>Affiliates will be eligible to get an extra commission if they can hit the requirements as indicated in the table above.</li>
            <li>Extra Commission will calculate from the final commission of the preceding month.</li>
            <li>Extra Commission will be credited with the final commission within the 08th - 15th of the month.</li>
            <li>12BET reserves the right to cancel this promotion at any time, either for all affiliates or individual affiliates and its subject to <a href="@Url.Content("~/TermAndCondition")">12BET Affiliates Terms and Conditions.</a></li>
        </ol>
    </p>
</div>
<div class="info-group">
    <p class="text-header"><strong>FDM's POWER</strong></p>
    <p class="text">
        <ol>
            <li>This promotion applies to all 12BET Affiliates.</li>
            <li>If the [NEW FDM's Reached] and [Total FDM's Deposit] are at different levels, the lower level will be used for commission calculation.</li>
            <li>Affiliates will be eligible to get an extra commission if they can hit the requirements as indicated in the table above.</li>
            <li>Extra Commission will calculate from the final commission of the preceding month.</li>
            <li>Extra Commission will be credited with the final commission within the 08th - 15th of the month.</li>
            <li>12BET reserves the right to cancel this promotion at any time, either for all affiliates or individual affiliates and its subject to <a href="@Url.Content("~/TermAndCondition")">12BET Affiliates Terms and Conditions.</a></li>
        </ol>
    </p>
</div>